{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the Blight grows with each passing day, the worlds wither in turn. The drifting planes that still light the sky fade like embers, and the powers that live to see them covet dominion of the few centuries that remain. A young man from a distant plane is taken from his home, and fights to find peace, before all ends in silence.</i>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on an adventure through a mysterious galaxy, blending intense FPS action with the strategy of RPGs.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An endlessly deep campaign, densely packed with dozens of hours of replayability.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GALACTIC JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new worlds in 3 main books, with 21 enormous chapters to be explored and plundered, each handcrafted and fully unique with their own aesthetic, lore, and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient temples, shadowy space piers, towering cities; all dense with loot, secrets, and deadly encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886740/extras/a3a3f46ef6d22992fd58aa1f53350b63.avif?t=1759082383\" width=1127 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RAW COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against 45 enemy types and 12 brutal bosses in combat combining bullet hell, hack-and-slash, and FPS. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each encounter is a dangerous test of skill and resourcefulness; when enemies are fighting at full capacity, you won't be pulling punches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886740/extras/f3796f64fb1ff2bdc6ece3965533812e.avif?t=1759082383\" width=1127 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH LURKS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Essence' from slain foes turns into a 'shard', which will revive you should your party fall. But die without any shards, and you lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving to the end of a book will take all your wits and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886740/extras/cd77ef0000f627120b15b1497a204c47.avif?t=1759082383\" width=1127 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR PARTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swash-buckle and parry with dual cutlasses, rocket jump with a mecha arm cannon, battle as a knight in explosive armour, or just throw big rocks at people. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 6 characters, 100+ unique weapons across 16 types, passive-granting armours, and items that  all make meaningful differences to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random loot means no two runs are the same, and equipping new loot gives you essence, so be ready to adapt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886740/extras/e7b7a175bcb27877a615fe033ba02092.avif?t=1759082383\" width=1127 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER THE PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a story inspired by classic pulp fantasy, equal parts mature and unhinged,  telling a personal tale atop a brewing intrigue and an ancient tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich and dense prose packs a sci-fi RPG epic into a blitzing FPS campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886740/extras/eb0046b506d55af900488285a2b5a899.avif?t=1759082383\" width=1127 height=294 /></span></p>","background":"